field":"half_life_range","proposed_value":"6-14 hours; reported values vary by trusted NCBI sources, with StatPearls listing plasma half-life 6-9 hours and an NCBI Bookshelf epilepsy text listing elimination half-life 12-14 hours.","reason":"Trusted NCBI sources provide half-life values; the row should not leave the pharmacokinetic field as N/A solely because the selected label omits it.","requires_user_approval":false,"source_urls":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK532282/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK2597/"]},{"current_value":"N/A - selected FDA/DailyMed label does not identify a major metabolic organ; renal bicarbonate handling and urinary effects are clinically central.","field":"major_organ_for_metabolism","proposed_value":"No major metabolism; renal excretion is the primary route of elimination.","reason":"NCBI sources state acetazolamide does not undergo metabolic alteration and is primarily renally eliminated.","requires_user_approval":false,"source_urls":["https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK532282/","https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/books/NBK2597/"]},{"current_value":"Acetazolamide; Acetazolamide Sodium; Diamox","field":"trade_names","proposed_value":"Acetazolamide; Acetazolamide Sodium; Diamox; Diamox Sequels","reason":"Add the missing FDA-labeled Diamox Sequels brand alias without deleting existing names.","requires_user_approval":false,"source_urls":["https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2024/012945s048lbl.pdf"]},{"current_value":"Diamox; acetazolamide sodium","field":"pubmed_search_aliases","proposed_value":"Diamox; Diamox Sequels; acetazolamide sodium","reason":"Add the missing extended-release capsule brand alias for search coverage.","requires_user_approval":false,"source_urls":["https://www.accessdata.fda.gov/drugsatfda_docs/label/2024/012945s048lbl.pdf"]},{"current_value":"Capsule; IV/IM injection; Long acting; Tablet","field":"filter_formulation","proposed_value":"Capsule; IV injection; Long acting; Tablet","reason"